
      AlgoMusic ToolManager Dockbrush
      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
             By Ville Ranki

    (Toolmanager © 1990-93 Stefan Becker)

How to put AlgoMusic in your TM dock:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  1-  Copy AlgoMusic.tb to where you have your other TM brushes.

  2-  Load the Toolmanager prefs program

  3-  Add new Exec object.

  4-  Object name is AlgoMusic, Exec type CLI, and Command 'Algomusic'.

  5-  Press Ok and Add new Image object.

  6-  Object name is AlgoMusic and filename is your AlgoMusic.tb file.

  7-  Press Ok and edit your Dock.

  8-  Edit Tools List and Add new tool with right Exec & Image objects.

  9-  Save your settings and try your new button.


